WorkFlow:
take 1 qasm file
>> insert split-point manually (=> automatic pragma insertion in *.dqc file)
>> look for split pragma
>> split orig file into numbered chunks of pure openqasm (i.e. remove split pragmas) into a dir named after the original qasm file; eventually [put stdlib include on top of each chunk]; also save a dqc file to keep the pragmas (split-points)
>> find out which data/vars are needed into next chunk (e.g. comments as header of each chunk)
>> teleportation should happen at runtime among worker-nodes according to their var-dependency analysis, XOR under controller orchestration: controller orchestrates comm among workers, but data is shared directly inter-workers via teleportation (control-plane VS data-plane).
